      "tone": "Modern social-media event, colorful, slightly ridiculous",
      "artistNote": "Do not align all gameplay positions into clean rows or columns. Each slot should feel naturally tied to a landmark. For Branch 2, the Zoe/Emma pair must clearly sit between VIP LOUNGE and SNACK TABLE, with one position visibly closer to each landmark. For Branch 3, the Ava/Noah pair must clearly sit between GIVEAWAY DISPLAY and VIP ACCESS, with one position visibly closer to each landmark. Camera, striped shirt, glasses, yellow jacket, and gift bag must all read clearly at gameplay scale.",
